Package: phoring
Type: Package
Title: Unified Econometric Estimation, Specification Testing, and Diagnostics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Md. Abid Siddique", "Emon", 
                  email = "contact.abidsiddique@gmail.com", 
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-6576-027X"))
Description: A unified econometric toolkit providing automated specification 
    testing, robust covariance estimation, and publication-grade academic 
    visualizations. Implements ordinary and weighted least squares with robust, 
    cluster-robust, and heteroskedasticity and autocorrelation consistent (HAC) 
    standard errors; instrumental variables two-stage least squares (2SLS); panel 
    data estimators (within fixed effects, two-way fixed effects, random effects 
    GLS, first differences); binary response models (logit and probit with average 
    marginal effects); tobit censored regression; count models (Poisson and negative 
    binomial); causal inference methods (difference-in-differences, sharp regression 
    discontinuity); quantile regression; dynamic time series models (autoregressive 
    distributed lag, Koyck distributed lag, Prais-Winsten AR(1), error correction 
    models, vector autoregression); and time series unit root batteries (augmented 
    Dickey-Fuller, Phillips-Perron, KPSS, Engle-Granger cointegration, Granger 
    causality, ARCH). Estimation routines integrate comprehensive diagnostic 
    batteries, parameter stability tests, and academic visualizations with zero 
    external package dependencies.
